  "description": "Temporal client and worker plumbing for QFace/QimErp services.\n      Provides unified connection options (address, namespace, TLS),\n      ITemporalClient registration, hosted worker registration, health check,\n      startup validation, worker versioning support, observability hooks,\n      and generic workflow operation abstractions (start, signal, query, terminate).\n      No domain-specific workflow types — those live in QimErp.Shared.Common.",
